  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 25 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">Europe is home to some of the world's most distinctive heli-skiing, from the Arctic fjords of Iceland and Norway to the big terrain of the Caucasus and the tightly regulated Alps. Each has its own character, season and access rules, and the best one depends on what you want. This is an honest guide to the best heli-skiing in Europe and where Iceland fits, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
